OL,3,AArgentine leader threatens to sanction
OL,4,Aoil firms working off Falklands
OL,5,
OL,6,FArgentina's president has heightened
OL,7,Ftensions with the UK over the Falkland
OL,8,FIslands, warning he will impose
OL,9,Feconomic sanctions on firms which
OL,10,Fexploit oil close to the British
OL,11,Foverseas territory.
OL,13,FIn a national address, Javier Milei
OL,14,Fsaid the "winds of change" favoured
OL,15,FArgentina's claim to the islands,
OL,16,Femboldened by signs the US might
OL,17,Freconsider its stance of neutrality on
OL,18,Fthe issue.
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  BusinessC Nat TVF  Nat News
