OL,3,AArgentine leader threatens to sanction
OL,4,Aoil firms working off Falklands
OL,5,
OL,6,FMilei said the Sea Lion oilfield, where
OL,7,Fa British and an Israeli firm are due
OL,8,Fto begin exploration work, was a "clear
OL,9,Fand present danger".
OL,11,FMore than 40 years after the war over
OL,12,Fthe territory, sovereignty of the
OL,13,Farchipelago in the south-west Atlantic
OL,14,FOcean remains hotly disputed between
OL,15,FBritain and Argentina.
